// RUN: hir-opt %s --pass-pipeline='builtin.module(builtin.function(transform-spills))' | filecheck %s

// A `cf.switch` with 256 cases plus a fallback, every arm branching to one join block, while
// %1 stays live across the join. The spill analysis counts, per value live into a join, the
// predecessors it arrives from; 257 executable predecessors overflowed the 8-bit count it used
// to keep (`attempt to add with overflow` in debug builds, a wrapped count in release builds).
// Nothing exceeds the operand stack here, so the function must come out without a spill.

